msgstr "Η Βελτιστοποίηση περιέχει ό,τι παίρνει κάθε παιχνίδι: Gamescope, Wine FSR, vkBasalt, lsfg-vk και MangoHud. Δύο τεχνολογίες που συγκρούονται δεν μένουν ποτέ ενεργές μαζί χωρίς να σας ρωτήσουν."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/profile_offer.rs:266
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/overview.rs:31
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:36
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/problems.rs:191
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/home.rs:1076
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/home.rs:1085
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/home.rs:1260
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/tutorial.rs:183
msgid "Turbo"
msgstr "Turbo"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/booster_button.rs:60
